---
// FaqSection.astro - Clean Light-Theme Objection Handling Accordion
---

<section class="section section-subtle faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-clean">
      <h2>
        Everything You Need to Know Before Switching
      </h2>
      <p>
        Straightforward answers to the most common questions high-volume merchants ask about underwriting, rates, and onboarding.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion-container">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Do you support high-risk and regulated industries?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Yes. We specialize in LegitScript-certified underwriting for dietary supplements, telehealth, online coaching, recurring subscriptions, CBD, and high-ticket B2B services. Unlike automated aggregators that blindly approve accounts and freeze them later, we pre-underwrite your business model upfront so your processing volume is permanently stable.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Is there a long-term contract or cancellation penalty?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            No. We operate strictly on a month-to-month basis. There are zero cancellation fees, zero lock-in agreements, and zero termination penalties. We believe in continuously earning your business every month through lower rates, reliable uptime, and dedicated human support.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How long does approval and account activation take?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Most merchant accounts are custom-underwritten and approved within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong>. Once approved, our onboarding specialists assist with your gateway API credentials or software integrations so you can begin processing within the same week.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>Will switching processors disrupt my active store or sales?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Zero disruption. Your existing processing account stays 100% active while we configure and test your new gateway routing in the background. We only transition customer traffic once your new account is live and fully verified.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>What information is needed for the free Rate Analysis?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            Just your basic monthly card volume and your most recent merchant processing statement. Our team performs an itemized, line-by-line fee comparison showing exactly how much cash you will save each month under Interchange-Plus pricing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span>How does Multi-Gateway failover protect my revenue?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-body">
          <p>
            OneFunding connects your checkout to redundant gateway pipelines (including NMI, Authorize.Net, and Fluidpay). If one network route experiences unexpected bank downtime or processing lag, transactions automatically route to a secondary gateway in milliseconds without your customers noticing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-accordion-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .faq-item[open] {
    border-color: var(--emerald-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .faq-question {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-icon {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--emerald-primary);
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .faq-body {
    padding: 0 1.5rem 1.35rem 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .faq-body strong {
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }
</style>
